Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:50.00,Footer,,0,0,0,,NASA SCIENCE SOURCES  •  ORIGINAL NARRATION
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:10.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pluto is smaller than Earth's Moon.\NThe drive-around claim isn't scientific.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:20.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pluto has five known moons. Charon is largest.\NThey orbit a shared point beyond Pluto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:30.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Dwarf planet is a scientific classification.\NPluto remains a complex world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:40.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,One Pluto year: about 248 Earth years.\NThis playful diagram has inaccurate labels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:50.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sputnik Planitia is rich in frozen nitrogen.\NA heart shape doesn't prove a warm interior.
